# Save compatibility: Welcome back. Sells a ₡1,000 1-year bond, then pretends the mod was off for
# 14 days (two weekly coupons missed). The dialog asks; "Start fresh from today" skips both
# coupons without paying them, and payments carry on from today.
name welcome back: start fresh skips the missed coupons
issue-bond 1 1000
away 14
expect-welcome-back shown
expect-log bonds: mod was off for 14 day(s); 2 payment(s) missed
capture welcome-back
welcome-back skip
expect-welcome-back hidden
expect-bond-coupons 2
expect-log bonds: welcome back after 14 day(s) away: started fresh (0 payment(s) moved)
cleanup:
redeem-new-bonds
